      en: ["Located in the Oti Region, situated directly along the international border with Togo.", "Dominated by the highly dramatic, steep topography of the Akwapim-Togo mountains.", "Encompasses Mount Dzebobo, which is the second-highest mountain peak in Ghana.", "The extreme elevation creates a unique, significantly cooler local microclimate.", "The rugged, highly inaccessible terrain naturally deters poaching and logging.", "Serves as a critical, pristine watershed for numerous rivers feeding into Lake Volta."]
