      en: ["A massive, powerful river entirely situated within the Western Region of Ghana.", "Originates near Wiawso and flows directly south into the Atlantic near Axim.", "The river basin drains the most intensely concentrated gold mining districts in the country.", "Historically navigable, allowing early colonial traders to penetrate the deep interior.", "Currently ranks as one of the most severely polluted major rivers in West Africa.", "Heavily contaminated by toxic cyanide and mercury runoff from illegal mining."]
